{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，一段行車視頻在網絡廣泛傳播，引發網友熱議。該視頻由一名問界M9車主自主上傳，<strong>可見他在高速公路開啓高階輔助駕駛後，直接癱倒在駕駛位熟睡，車輛依靠智駕系統自主跟車、變道</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587386.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.202620+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T10:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_hash":"af152c2d8e3106ca6f0c6f36dc8f19aea05f80a1695d6d35c976cd2b91cf8145","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}